1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,425
Business Case 10 begins when an accepted application becomes eligible
for controlled onboarding handoff.

2
00:00:06,425 --> 00:00:11,014
Candidate, application, PreHire and PendingWorker remain linked,
correctable and reconciled.

3
00:00:11,014 --> 00:00:13,309
The governed record is NHR-DEMO-001.

4
00:00:13,309 --> 00:00:18,816
The accountable actors are People Operations, HRIS Operator,
Configuration Admin, New Hire.

5
00:00:18,816 --> 00:00:25,700
This demonstration uses synthetic browser-memory data and creates no
database, provider, message or external-system effect.

6
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:30,297
The action-level data-flow diagram defines 4 processes before product
navigation.

7
00:00:30,297 --> 00:00:38,573
Every process identifies the actor, screen, action, input, output,
business object, event, governed store, rule, denial and recovery.

8
00:00:38,573 --> 00:00:43,171
The highlighted path keeps each business grain and version distinct.

9
00:00:43,171 --> 00:00:46,370
Process 1, People Operations: Confirm identity lineage.

10
00:00:46,370 --> 00:00:52,312
The action review source versions produces eligible handoff projection
in the Handoff ledger.

11
00:00:52,312 --> 00:00:55,512
Process 2, Configuration Admin: Assign approved template.

12
00:00:55,512 --> 00:01:02,368
The action test population and pin version produces version-pinned
onboarding plan in the Onboarding ledger.

13
00:01:02,368 --> 00:01:06,024
Process 3, HRIS Operator: Map and validate worker.

14
00:01:06,024 --> 00:01:12,880
The action compare source and destination fields produces staged
pendingworker in the HRIS staging ledger.

15
00:01:12,880 --> 00:01:16,079
Process 4, New Hire: Activate purpose-limited identity.

16
00:01:16,079 --> 00:01:22,935
The action accept invitation and review profile produces active new-hire
session in the Identity ledger.

17
00:01:22,935 --> 00:01:25,969
The actual product route is /hr/onboarding/new-hires/NHR-DEMO-001.

18
00:01:25,969 --> 00:01:33,554
It presents prehire and pendingworker mapping and reconciliation in the
surrounding recruitment or onboarding workspace.

19
00:01:33,554 --> 00:01:46,195
The screen remains a wireframe, but its identifiers, current state,
navigation, data relationships and action boundaries match the business
contract used by the connected workbench.

20
00:01:46,195 --> 00:01:48,782
The seeded workbench follows record PWH-DEMO-001.

21
00:01:48,782 --> 00:02:00,852
Its governed fields are PreHire, PRE-DEMO-001 , source offer v4;
PendingWorker, PWH-DEMO-001 , staged; Mapping, MAP-HRIS-012 , v8;
Business key, PRE-DEMO-001|2026-11-16; Location source, SF-HYBRID;
Destination result, SF-CA-HYBRID invalid.

22
00:02:00,852 --> 00:02:09,043
Field classifications remain visible so the presenter can distinguish
public, internal, confidential and restricted projections for the active
persona.

23
00:02:09,043 --> 00:02:13,430
With People Operations selected, we perform stage and reconcile worker.

24
00:02:13,430 --> 00:02:18,695
The guard requires identity lineage, mapping version, required fields
and idempotency pass.

25
00:02:18,695 --> 00:02:30,541
The state changes from Staged with 1 error to Reconciled, records
PendingWorkerReconciled, writes to the HRIS staging ledger, and creates
the handoff: New hire receives purpose-limited invitation.

26
00:02:30,541 --> 00:02:34,649
We now exercise the controlled exception: Simulate location-code
rejection.

27
00:02:34,649 --> 00:02:38,758
The prepared failure is Destination rejects SF-CA-HYBRID location code.

28
00:02:38,758 --> 00:02:48,344
Unsupported downstream work stops, successful prior evidence remains
intact, and the state-change receipt assigns explicit recovery without
hiding the failed attempt.

29
00:02:48,344 --> 00:02:51,753
The owned recovery is Correct mapping and replay.

30
00:02:51,753 --> 00:02:56,015
It reuses the governed business context without duplicating completed
effects.

31
00:02:56,015 --> 00:03:01,554
The new receipt preserves previous state, current state, actor, event
and correlation key.

32
00:03:01,554 --> 00:03:10,930
The control center and handoff inbox then expose the same recovery
through first-pass validation, retries and reconciliation age and
minimum-context next-actor work.

33
00:03:10,930 --> 00:03:13,167
Business Case 10 is complete.

34
00:03:13,167 --> 00:03:26,141
We demonstrated the level-two process contract, the actual product
route, governed field projections, the primary state transition, a
controlled exception, targeted recovery, causal dashboard evidence and
the next-actor handoff.

35
00:03:26,141 --> 00:03:30,615
Candidate, application, PreHire and PendingWorker remain linked,
correctable and reconciled.

36
00:03:30,615 --> 00:03:35,537
Production identity, persistence, integrations and external delivery
remain separate implementation gates.
